{{Unobtainable}}
'''Cow Princess''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 65
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Cow Princess
|name2 = Giraffe Princess
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Giraffe Princess''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Against most enemies, this Cat is essentially [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] with slightly higher damage at the same level. Against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, Cow Princess deals considerably more damage, which can be useful for the early game, though this assumes that the player has no better Cats to beat Dark enemies at that point. Unfortunately, beyond the early game, Cow Princess shares the same fate as many other collaboration units due to low HP and Single Target, even with the extra attack power against Dark enemies. At least it's better than [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], though.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher}}

